od-tome.lua","source":"Your stone spikes grow in length, instantly dealing %0.1f Physical damage and disarming targets hit for %d turns.\n\t\tThe damage increases with Spellpower and the chance to disarm increases with either Spellpower or Physical Power, whichever is greater.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"强化你的岩石尖刺，造成 %0.1f 物理伤害，并缴械 %d 回合。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成；缴械的施加几率受法术强度和物理强度中较高者加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d4bfa9bc33b843890fef60d128ae6434bac62669145b6e7ffa0ce8f52691fc66","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"21207f3ae5c1503a18074c71a593ba8bfd1880f858b7862de444e04868ddc2ec","logical_entry_identity":"452630420bddfa49b841a635c1a2c5c7ce2469bab9c43756a884cb96d1cbc550","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Form and Function","source_tag":"talent name","target":"武器护甲改造"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d63ee6ab804cddaf34111dddc463bd3c6aa4621bb42dc0e19d74a4277756d99e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"21219d63410f538b4b8611e9c0f2aa261c817245cbfa9d503bc80ee860e71095","logical_entry_identity":"7c5eaafdbb447646727c20e41a420e769f750dc11cae3724cd36ab0b6f0205ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This heavy dwarven-steel armour was created in the deepest forges of the Iron Throne. While it grants incomparable protection, it demands that you rely only on your own strength.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这件沉重的矮人钢护甲打造于钢铁王座最深的熔炉。虽然它被赋予了举世无双的防护能力，但你必须得靠自己的力量使用它。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"894f354e5057c16b9e3c2002af8ae55db02efd5c11c2a882510964df06975daa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"21224e4bb841bd84d16f262865020f5ac1581aef8838b4957e28ec51bf946fd3","logical_entry_identity":"865947af86951810999f246b33284d0ba74cc8cc3b8fce39aaefacf04211189e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"When you throw your alchemist bombs, you infuse them with explosive acid that can blind.\n\t\tIn addition all acid damage you do is increased by %d%%.\n\t\tYou cannot have more than one alchemist infusion sustain active at once.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"投掷炼金炸弹时，你会向其中灌注能够致盲敌人的爆炸性酸液。\n\t\t此外，你造成的所有酸性伤害增加 %d%%。\n\t\t同一时间只能激活一种炼金充能持续技能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"08ba8096d2e9a69ac295fcb865708ffa0796ec99407703a514b60454c09953b8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"212892227ae55d8efb97adf7449a8a3e37c5dc7e1f9450bb17e5ca36bbac5eb5","logical_entry_identity":"2f895086fcd4e5f0c84195fe948c4cfdc24677525e7983be7819eba1dd7ed743","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Immobilized","source_tag":"_t","target":"固定"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bdfdd48e9d7a640130391fa9523019c52990d7bc61e243b829b9b537c36d2a22","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"212e7078115bf7e9515e520494ef66d8bbc12eff1e8423b51659b655b77fe41c","logical_entry_identity":"91476bfd228df396755c8a5f29c8247dea663f2c648c9ad35f9eb9eb7fa0ec0b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your sacrifice worked. Your mental energies were imbued with farportal energies. The Way radiated from the High Peak toward the rest of Eyal like a mental tidal wave.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你的牺牲起作用了，你的精神能量被远传送门能量所灌注。维网从巅峰向埃亚尔各处辐射出一股精神冲击波。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4bf34671ab7164140f367ecfe2fd952443172a1a5ac4b0798120a9936b1e658d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"212f42d27d97bdb669612ecdc5cd0e09cfb0ab0f22f68b568d81f8719ce789eb","logical_entry_identity":"521ccb72fa23e83a5fa7a81800d0a31b6daa9699d97d9b36e40b1180184a8294","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"flame-wrought amulet","source_tag":"_t","target":"火焰制造的护符"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"12ae42b2b6b5fe6bb988f89827b80b1f870ca900beaf2b5a858eb1ab7b51cc6a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"213d0383c569bf71fda0fbad223000537ebbd3be6c844f5ecb6421c03e5b76b4","logical_entry_identity":"3ab8a621f62db2324af55a866e61c5fb84e0adf7d771101b6681476c627464f5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You learn to maintain your agility and manage your combat posture while wearing robes or light armour.  When wearing armour no heavier than leather in your main body slot, you gain %d Defense, %d%% Armour hardiness, and %d%% reduced Fatigue.\n\t\tIn addition, when you step adjacent to a (visible) enemy, you use the juxtaposition to increase your total Defense by %d for 2 turns.\n\t\tThe Defense bonus scales with your Dexterity.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你学会在身着轻甲和布甲时保持敏捷，获得 %d 闪避，%d%% 护甲强度，减少 %d%% 疲劳。\n\t\t此外，每当你进入和（可见的）敌人相邻的位置时，你获得 %d 闪避，持续 2 回合。\n\t\t闪避受敏捷加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"379d2e6f4309485c28d431afb0006cfd35872d07c40eebbc49a317fc79d2368d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"213d997913594dc0c0aa2bb6aa0af7a5dbcfe2991d1967d614d1c1c4d3c0730e","logical_entry_identity":"34f7598e583fd2b9bfc5de945b4b71b8bbef7d886bbdbc3e98b79ee12751221a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Bathes the target in frost doing %0.2f damage\n\t\tThe damage will increase with Spellpower","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用霜冻侵袭目标，造成 %0.2f 点寒冷伤害。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eded1522a2d81ab3218a4544b895a8e59baea3915a04c58d3a5666d714a2cca7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"213e0da578280e791dbbdc18a43b6c23d00691ef4c1bda8f42223761dbb8b1c4","logical_entry_identity":"903e077f6c5ace396d057faaeef455b573c66c48138ca7cd18de6f0003e6686e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Flamewrought","source_tag":"entity name","target":"炽焰手套"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d094bc61bffb4c682ac0e08d3a0a48ee1dd5cd207bcc4534203bb7f56a5ca2f4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"2143a2c7a4e9748b0526a143f9087cedf9c162c7be4f80a48d0ad395213950d1","logical_entry_identity":"0d05baaac67f43084dee35731aa0d0c63a2d6d64d569f15429c2f0a63aa806aa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Constricted","source_tag":"_t","target":"+缠绕"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"db182d2f1f860ab343db3c25ea9cce50d53425673f3fa209555bac135a828fbd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"21455574acf9d03dc0146556a46ec066350870143770c38694e16a4ed1c5b690","logical_entry_identity":"8c077e63bac1